  "(Default): its own ULTRAKILL theme.": "（默认）：其专属ULTRAKILL主题曲。",
  "A beaten boss goes out as ULTRAKILL ends its fight: Minos and Sisyphus Prime fall to their knees, say their last words and rise in light before they burst; Gabriel rages and vanishes. Minecraft's end of the fight waits for it.": "击败首领时播放原版退场动画。原版战斗结算将在动画结束后进行。",
  "A boss makes its entrance as ULTRAKILL brings it in (V2 drops in and bows, Gabriel appears in a pillar of light, the Primes speak), with ULTRAKILL's title card. It can't be hurt and doesn't attack until it's done. Short: a few seconds. Full: everything ULTRAKILL has it say first (Minos and Sisyphus Prime's whole speeches).": "首领登场时播放原版演出与标题卡，期间首领处于无敌且不攻击状态。Short：数秒；Full：完整对白。",
  "A boss takes you (and the V1s with you) to its own arena, built after the room ULTRAKILL fights it in, and back when the fight is over.": "首领突袭时将你（及同行的V1队友）一同传送至对应的原版主题竞技场交战，战后全员安全返回。",
  "A different ULTRAKILL song each fight.": "每场战斗随机播放一首ULTRAKILL歌曲。",
  "ARENA": "竞技场",
  "ARENA CLEARED": "竞技场通关",
  "About how many minutes of play pass between bosses.": "两场首领突袭之间大约间隔的实际游玩时间（分钟）。",
  "Absorption hearts (golden apples and potions) expand V1's maximum health: the health bar and readout extend to include them, and fresh blood refills them back to the boosted cap. Off: absorption acts as a temporary shield that absorbs damage first but cannot be refilled by blood.": "伤害吸收黄心直接计入V1最大生命值上限，且可通过吸血回满。关闭时仅作为无法通过吸血回复的一次性护盾。",
  "All (8,192)": "全部（8,192）",
  "All Weapons & Arms": "解锁全套武器与手臂",
  "Allow ULTRAKILL interactions for all currently visible mobs.": "允许当前列表所有可见生物与ULTRAKILL交互。",
  "Allowed: affected by ULTRAKILL weapons, attacks, Whiplash, and blasts.": "允许：会被ULTRAKILL的武器、攻击、勾爪与爆炸命中。",
  "Alt Fire": "副开火",
  "Always plays its standard level entrance (follows Boss Intros: Short or Full).": "始终播放该Boss的标准入场（受「Boss入场」的「简短 / 完整」影响）。",
  "Arenas themed after ULTRAKILL's layers of Hell generate in new parts of the world, each with a boss waiting inside.": "在未探索的新区块中生成以地狱各层为主题的古老竞技场，内部皆有专属首领镇守。",
  "As in 0-5: one statue wakes; the second only once the first is down to half its health.": "开场仅苏醒一座看门犬石像，其生命值降至一半后第二座才会苏醒。",
  "As in 1-4: at a third of its health it's knocked down and flees through a flash of light. That's a win.": "生命值降至1/3时撤退，直接判定玩家胜利。",
  "As in 5-2: throw a Marksman coin at him and he takes it and lets you pass. The fight is over, without its reward.": "向摆渡人投掷一枚神枪手硬币可直接结束战斗放行，但不发放奖励。",
  "As in its level": "关卡原版机制",
  "As the Cyber Grind has him: no entrance speech, no death scene, a quick death.": "跳过开场白与退场演出，击败后立即结束战斗。",
  "Auto": "自动",
  "Back": "向后移动",
  "Back as Steve (%s), ULTRAKILL's enemies stay and keep fighting: you see them, and they come for Steve. Off: they wait, frozen, until you're V1 again.": "切回史蒂夫形态（%s）后，ULTRAKILL敌人保持活跃并攻击史蒂夫（造成原版红心伤害）。关闭时敌人原地冻结，直到切换为V1。",
  "Beating it pays nothing and doesn't count as beaten (no P, loot or experience; your boss count and difficulty stay as they are).": "练习赛击败后不发放P点、战利品与经验，亦不计入通关击杀计数与难度演化。",
