  "Everything on this page back as it came: 720p, frame rate matching Minecraft, High effects, all blood stains, extra gore, 128 blocks of terrain.": "将本页各项参数恢复为初始出厂设置：720p、跟随Minecraft帧率、高品质特效、全量血渍、开启额外血腥、128格地形视距。",
