  "How far around V1 Minecraft's terrain becomes ULTRAKILL's walls and floors. Less is faster for both games; beyond it, shots fly through hills and ULTRAKILL's effects show through them.": "以V1为中心将Minecraft地形同步为碰撞体的范围。范围越小性能越好；超出范围外弹道与特效将穿透地形。",
  "How fast it moves and attacks (ULTRAKILL's own speed modifier).": "首领移动与施展攻击的速率倍率（ULTRAKILL原版速度乘数）。",
  "How hard bosses are. Auto: they get harder the more of them V1 has beaten.": "调整首领挑战难度。Auto（自适应）：击败的首领越多，后续首领难度越高。",
  "How hard explosions and hits shake the camera.": "爆炸与剧烈受击时镜头的晃动幅度。",
