  "Starting Minecraft starts ULTRAKILL too (through Steam), and closing Minecraft closes it.": "启动Minecraft时通过Steam同步调起ULTRAKILL，关闭Minecraft时同步退出。",
  "Starting the Cyber Grind at a shop takes you into its arena as ULTRAKILL has it: a 16 x 16 grid of columns that shifts into a new pattern every wave. Its temporary shop takes you back. Off: the waves come round the shop you started it from.": "在商店终端开启电子血宫时，传送至虚空之上的16x16升降立柱矩阵挑战。关闭时怪潮将在当前商店周围就地刷出。",
