  "The Cyber Grind is on around a shop: fight there with them.": "商店周围已开启电子血宫：与同伴协同作战吧。",
  "The Cyber Grind is over (%s): wave %s, best %s": "电子血宫结束 (%s)：第%s波，最佳%s",
  "The Cyber Grind: waves of enemies around this shop. Dying or leaving ends it.": "电子血宫：敌人群体将在商店周围涌现。阵亡或离开将结束挑战。",
  "The OP Shop, the shop's screen, style rewards.": "OP超额商店、高分终端界面、风格连杀奖励。",
  "The Sandbox's Spawner Arm in weapon slot 6: spawn ULTRAKILL's enemies and props anywhere.": "在第6武器槽装备沙盒生成手臂，可自由生成敌人与道具。",
  "The camera leans into strafes and slides.": "侧身移动与滑铲时视角产生倾斜沉浸效果。",
  "The shop is ULTRAKILL's: become V1 (%s) and walk up to the screen": "这是ULTRAKILL的商店：切换为V1（%s）后走到屏幕前即可使用",
  "The shop is ULTRAKILL's: start ULTRAKILL and become V1 to use it": "这是ULTRAKILL的商店：启动ULTRAKILL并切换为V1后即可使用",
  "The shop sells everything for free.": "商店终端内所有武器与升级免费获取。",
  "The shop's Upgrades page goes much further: every weapon's and arm's Power up to 1500%, and blast sizes (Payload, Shockwave, the mini nuke) up to 1500%.": "允许在商店终端将武器与手臂威力、爆炸范围最高强化至1500%。",
  "The song that plays when %s comes.": "%s登场时播放的曲目。",
