  "ULTRAKILL While Steve": "史蒂夫遭遇ULTRAKILL敌人",
  "ULTRAKILL hands each frame to Minecraft as soon as it's drawn, rather than a frame or two later: less input lag. On a slow graphics card, off may give a few more frames a second.": "画面渲染完成即刻交付，大幅降低输入延迟。显卡性能较弱时，关闭可略微提高帧率。",
  "ULTRAKILL hasn't listed its soundtrack yet: start it (or open a world) and come back.": "ULTRAKILL尚未列出曲目列表：请启动ULTRAKILL或进入世界后再试。",
  "ULTRAKILL runs at half speed.": "ULTRAKILL以0.5倍速运行。",
  "ULTRAKILL's HUD (health, style, weapon) isn't drawn.": "隐藏屏幕上的血条、风格计分与武器图标等界面。",
  "ULTRAKILL's Sandbox cheats and a few of Ultracraft's.": "ULTRAKILL官方沙盒作弊与Ultracraft专属特供作弊。",
  "ULTRAKILL's blood (it still heals V1 with this off).": "ULTRAKILL原版血液显示（关闭依然能正常吸血回血）。",
  "ULTRAKILL's bosses come for V1 now and then, with a warning first.": "ULTRAKILL首领会随机向V1突袭，降临前会有预警提示。",
  "ULTRAKILL's difficulty for V1 and its enemies while playing Ultracraft: Harmless gives V1 200 health; harder ones make enemies faster and deadlier. Enemies already out keep theirs.": "游玩Ultracraft时V1与敌人的原版难度：Harmless赋予200生命；高难度下敌人攻速与致命度更高。",
  "ULTRAKILL's enemies around V1 die (Minecraft's monsters don't).": "瞬间消灭V1周围的所有ULTRAKILL敌人（不伤及Minecraft原版怪物）。",
  "ULTRAKILL's enemies can't be killed.": "ULTRAKILL敌人无法被杀死。",
  "ULTRAKILL's enemies can't see V1.": "ULTRAKILL敌人无法察觉V1。",
  "ULTRAKILL's enemies fight each other (and Minecraft's monsters).": "ULTRAKILL敌人会互相攻击，并攻击Minecraft原版怪物。",
  "ULTRAKILL's enemies leave V1 alone.": "ULTRAKILL敌人不再攻击V1。",
  "ULTRAKILL's enemies spawn in the dark, like Minecraft's monsters: which ones depends on the biome and the dimension. Its bosses and the Cyber Grind still come.": "允许ULTRAKILL敌人在此维度的黑暗处自然生成。首领突袭与电子血宫不受此限。",
  "ULTRAKILL's enemies' shots, beams, blasts and fire break blocks.": "ULTRAKILL敌人的射击弹道、高能光束、爆炸和火焰可破坏方块。",
  "ULTRAKILL's field of view; Minecraft's world is drawn to match.": "ULTRAKILL视野范围；Minecraft视角将同步对齐。",
  "ULTRAKILL's mouse sensitivity (its default is 50).": "ULTRAKILL内部鼠标灵敏度（默认50）。",
  "ULTRAKILL's music (fights, bosses, the Cyber Grind).": "ULTRAKILL各类背景音乐音量（战斗、首领、电子血宫）。",
  "ULTRAKILL's music in fights: which song, boss themes, volumes.": "ULTRAKILL战斗音乐选择、首领主题曲与各通道音量。",
  "ULTRAKILL's resolution and frame rate, effects, blood stains, terrain range, and a Low-End PC preset.": "ULTRAKILL渲染分辨率、帧率上限、特效品质、血渍留存量、地形同步视距与低配优化预设。",
  "Ultracraft Settings": "Ultracraft设置",
  "Ultracraft and ULTRAKILL settings": "Ultracraft与ULTRAKILL相关设置",
  "Ultracraft's extra blood on every death (sprays and bursts on top of ULTRAKILL's own). Off: just ULTRAKILL's own.": "击杀敌人时喷溅的额外高密度血雾与血花。关闭后仅保留ULTRAKILL原版自带的击杀血液效果。",
  "Ultracraft...": "Ultracraft...",
  "Using a shop, ULTRAKILL draws at full resolution so the text is sharp (costs frames while you use it).": "打开商店终端时以全分辨率渲染文字以保持清晰（使用时可能轻微降低帧率）。",
  "V1 Breaks Blocks": "V1方块破坏",
  "V1 flies through walls and blocks (ULTRAKILL's cheat).": "V1可直接穿透墙壁与方块自由飞行。",
  "V1 flies: jump to rise, slide to sink (ULTRAKILL's cheat).": "V1开启飞行模式：跳跃键上升，滑铲键下降。",
  "V1 runs 60% faster.": "V1移动速度提升60%。",
  "V1's Red Explosions Hit as Melee": "红色爆炸视为蓝拳判定",
