  "V1's guns (%s for Minecraft hands)": "V1的枪械（按%s换成Minecraft双手）",
  "V1's guns and arms aren't drawn.": "隐藏持握的枪械与手臂模型。",
  "V1's guns, punches, slams and blasts break blocks.": "V1的枪械射击、重拳、震荡砸地与爆炸可破坏方块。",
